OL,3,GNEWSA'There is hope': Football coach
OL,4,Ashares anorexia recovery journey to
OL,5,Ahelp others
OL,6,
OL,7,FJordan Caldwell has battled anorexia
OL,8,Fsince he was 12 years old.
OL,10,FNow 30 - an age his parents feared he
OL,11,Fwould not reach - Jordan marked this
OL,12,Fmilestone birthday with a long-awaited
OL,13,Fgym photoshoot.
OL,15,FAfter reaching out to a personal
OL,16,Ftrainer, Jordan, who is a youth
OL,17,Ffootball coach, said it was "the day
OL,18,Feverything changed for the better".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
